{"3106510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Floor 9", "steam_appid": 3106510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nine floors down. Pay attention.</h2>Hotel Liminal gives you one corridor and two buttons. One says there is an anomaly. One says there is not. Only one of them takes you closer to the exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/1b1b05fbd334f9401e61157d7918b403.poster.avif?t=1787959995\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/1b1b05fbd334f9401e61157d7918b403.webm?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/1b1b05fbd334f9401e61157d7918b403.mp4?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look at everything</h2>Step out of the elevator and walk the floor. The paintings, the doors, the signs, the lights, the carpet, the windows. Nothing announces itself. A door that was closed is open. A painting hangs an inch lower than it did yesterday. Or nothing has moved at all, and the only thing standing between you and the next floor is your own doubt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/415feb815f12c1d3d92fa848740b9cb8.poster.avif?t=1787959995\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/415feb815f12c1d3d92fa848740b9cb8.webm?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/415feb815f12c1d3d92fa848740b9cb8.mp4?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Nine floors, one way out.</strong> Every floor is a fresh judgement call, and every mistake costs you the entire descent.<br></li><li><strong>Two buttons, no hints.</strong> No map, no marker, no going back. You either saw it or you did not.<br></li><li><strong>A hotel built to be looked at closely.</strong> Warm lights, patterned carpet, paintings on every wall, all of it there to make you doubt yourself.<br></li><li><strong>Sound doing half the work.</strong> Play it loud, play it in the dark, and see how far you get.<br></li><li><strong>A focused run.</strong> Most players reach the exit in under an hour. This is a game you finish, not one you grind.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/90e9dd7600782e7b4eec908c5ea81b75.poster.avif?t=1787959995\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/90e9dd7600782e7b4eec908c5ea81b75.webm?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/90e9dd7600782e7b4eec908c5ea81b75.mp4?t=1787959995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The exit is nine floors below you. Take your time.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nine floors down. Pay attention.</h2>Hotel Liminal gives you one corridor and two buttons. One says there is an anomaly. One says there is not. Only one of them takes you closer to the exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106510/extras/1b1b05fbd334f9401e61157d7918b403.poster.avif?t=1787959995\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s